      "data": {
        "text": "**Defining the Python Script**\n\nI'm currently focused on defining the initial Python script, `embed_batch.py`, that will generate embeddings for a text batch. I've decided to use Google Cloud's `vertexai` library as the embedding provider, and I'll ensure its usage is clearly identifiable within the code.\n\n\n**Constructing the Core Script**\n\nI'm now diving into the implementation of `embed_batch.py`, starting with the `embed_batch` function itself. I've integrated the `vertexai` library, focusing on loading the embedding model via `TextEmbeddingModel.from_pretrained`. Currently, I'm setting up the call to `model.embed_documents` to obtain the embeddings and will soon include identifiers to distinguish the provider.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789860037634,
          "start": 1789860036278
        },
        "type": "reasoning"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bbf8beb60011BkeELMm9W9p6Y",
