      "data": {
        "text": "**Choosing the Embedding Provider**\n\nI've decided to proceed with Google Cloud's Vertex AI for generating text embeddings. This choice simplifies the implementation and offers scalable options. The next step is to integrate Vertex AI into the Python file to generate embeddings for a single text string.\n\n\n**Defining the Script's Structure**\n\nI'm starting the `embed_text.py` script. The plan is to include necessary imports, a function to handle text input, leverage Vertex AI, and return the generated embedding vector. I'm focusing on clearly identifying Google Cloud's Vertex AI as the provider within the code, specifically through the import and model selection. Using the `write` tool will allow me to create this Python file.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789860032748,
          "start": 1789860030313
        },
        "type": "reasoning"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bbf8a769001SJFxSt8ySgy9Of",
